    <system:String x:Key="Editor_HelpCreateTitle">创建与选择</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Editor_HelpCreateBody" xml:space="preserve">• 双击空白处：创建音符
• 单击音符：选择并拖动
• Ctrl + 单击：追加或取消选择
• 拖动空白处：框选；Ctrl + 框选：追加选择
• Ctrl + 拖动音符：复制
• Delete / Backspace：删除；Ctrl + Z / Ctrl + Y：撤销 / 重做</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Editor_HelpRhythmTitle">节奏与时值</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Editor_HelpRhythmBody" xml:space="preserve">• 右键音符：设置节拍长度和按键持续比例
• [：缩短选中音符；]：延长选中音符
• 未选择音符时，[ / ] 调整吸附网格</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Editor_HelpNavigationTitle">导航与试听</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Editor_HelpNavigationBody" xml:space="preserve">• 单击或拖动顶部时间尺：设置播放游标
• 空格：播放 / 暂停本地试听
• 选择音符后启用循环按钮：循环试听选区
• Ctrl + 滚轮：水平缩放；Shift + 滚轮：横向滚动
• Ctrl + Shift + 滚轮：垂直缩放</system:String>
